      "level": 1,
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Q: One of the more frustrating challenges I've encountered in my role as Head of Design has been the many disparate sources of truth. As one example, the design team has a prioritized roadmap doc created in partnership with product managers AND the eng team has a different roadmap doc (using a totally different tool). That's broken, true?",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/3",
      "text": "Q: One of the more frustrating challenges I've encountered in my role as Head of Design has been the many disparate sources of truth. As one example, the design team has a prioritized roadmap doc created in partnership with product managers AND the eng team has a different roadmap doc (using a totally different tool). That's broken, true?"
    },
