    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Though it's normal for high-growth companies to go through periods where there are more tools than people, and for teams to have a Google Doc who’s sole purpose is to keeps track of all of the other Google Docs, you should always look for opportunities to streamline your tools and processes. This is",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/0"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/6",
      "text": "Though it's normal for high-growth companies to go through periods where there are more tools than people, and for teams to have a Google Doc who’s sole purpose is to keeps track of all of the other Google Docs, you should always look for opportunities to streamline your tools and processes. This is"
    },
